# Keep local artefacts out of the demo images: the images need only the
# demo's own source, and install the SDK and dependencies from
# requirements.txt. `**/` also matches the demo root.

# ── Local configuration (may hold machine-specific values) ──────────
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Virtual environments and local data ─────────────────────────────
**/.venv
**/venv
**/_data

# ── Python caches and build output ──────────────────────────────────
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.egg-info
**/dist
**/build
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov

# ── OS files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
